#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:89
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libvpx"
msgstr "Instalação do libvpx"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libvpx</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libvpx</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:96
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's/cp -p/cp/' build/make/Makefile &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir libvpx-build            &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    libvpx-build            &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"../configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"             --enable-shared  \\\n"
"             --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's/cp -p/cp/' build/make/Makefile &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"mkdir libvpx-build            &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    libvpx-build            &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"../configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"             --enable-shared  \\\n"
"             --disable-static &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:107
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>LD_LIBRARY_PATH=. make test</command>."
"  The test suite downloads many files as part of its test process.  A few "
"parts of it will use all available cores."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>LD_LIBRARY_PATH=. make "
"test</command>. A suíte de teste baixa muitos arquivos como parte do "
"processo de teste dela. Algumas partes usarão todos os elementos de "
"processamento disponíveis."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:117
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:122
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>sed ... </command>: This command corrects the ownership and "
"permissions of installed files."
msgstr ""
"<command>sed ... </command>: Esse comando corrige a titularidade de "
"propriedade e as permissões dos arquivos instalados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:130
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>mkdir libvpx-build &amp;&amp; cd libvpx-build</command>: The "
"<application>libvpx</application> developers recommend building in a "
"dedicated build directory."
msgstr ""
"<command>mkdir libvpx-build &amp;&amp; cd libvpx-build</command>: Os(As) "
"desenvolvedores(as) da <application>libvpx</application> recomendam "
"construir em um diretório de construção dedicado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-vp8</option>: This switch prevents building support for "
"the VP8 codec."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-vp8</option>: Essa chave impede construir suporte para o "
"codificador VP8."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:144
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-vp9</option>: This switch prevents building support for "
"the VP9 codec."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-vp9</option>: Essa chave impede construir suporte para o "
"codificador VP9."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--target=generic-gnu</option>: This switch disables optimizations "
"specific to x86 and x86-64, allowing to build this package without "
"<command>nasm</command> and <command>yasm</command> installed."
msgstr ""
"<option>--target=generic-gnu</option>: Essa chave desabilita otimizações "
"específicas para x86 e x86-64, permitindo construir esse pacote sem "
"<command>nasm</command> e <command>yasm</command> instalados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/libvpx.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>LD_LIBRARY_PATH=.</command>: This is needed for the test suite to "
"use the library that was just built."
msgstr ""
"<command>LD_LIBRARY_PATH=.</command>: Isso é necessário para a suíte de "
"teste usar a biblioteca que foi recém construída."

